<title>USA: Hardinge sees 96 net in-line with estimates.</title>
<headline>Hardinge sees 96 net in-line with estimates.</headline>
<dateline>ELMIRA, N.Y. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hardinge Inc said Wednesday it expects net income for 1996 to be in line with analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>Earlier in the day the company reported net income of $3.4 million, or $0.56 per share. First Call consensus estimate put the company's quarter at $0.49 per share. First Call lists the company's 1996 earnings at $2.70 per share.</p>
</text>
